OL,3,GNEWSABarn owl chick numbers 'exceed
OL,4,Aexpectations'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWildlife campaigners on Teesside are
OL,7,Fcelebrating a bumper year for the barn
OL,8,Fowl population.
OL,10,FThe Tees Valley Wildlife Trust has been
OL,11,Frunning a project to boost the number
OL,12,Fof birds, which has been in decline due
OL,13,Fto a loss of nesting habitats, by
OL,14,Finstalling nest boxes sponsored by the
OL,15,Fpublic.
OL,17,FVolunteers have been putting rings on
OL,18,Fowlets to track their location and
OL,19,Fsurvival. Last year they ringed 270
OL,20,Fchicks, so far this year they have done
OL,21,F541.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,394,390,260,160,0,100
