OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSABarn owl chick numbers 'exceed
OL,4,Aexpectations'
OL,5,
OL,6,FColin Gibson, lead volunteer for the
OL,7,Fproject said the 2026 breeding season
OL,8,Fhad "exceeded all expectations", with
OL,9,Fthe success being put down to a mild
OL,10,Fwinter, dry summer and the
OL,11,Fspecially-designed boxes.
